%% The figure is a conceptual system boundary; measured results are cited in the manuscript.
flowchart LR
    B[Self-describing adapter bundle\nABI · vocabulary · digest · capabilities] --> V{Contract validation}
    V -->|valid zero-base| Z[Zero-base lane\nbase = None\nstandalone specialist]
    V -->|valid attached ABI| A[Attached lane\nexplicit base identity]
    V -->|invalid or unsafe| R[Refusal\nno execution]
    Z --> F[Versioned front door\nrequest · budget · permissions]
    A --> F
    F --> G[Capability registry\nroute individual specialists]
    G --> C[Decision-space coordination\nprovided · contributing · abstaining]
    C --> T[Tool boundary\nschema → execution → postcondition]
    T --> O[Outcome\nsuccess · abstention · rejection]
    O --> L[Lifecycle\ncandidate → canary → approval\npromotion or rollback]
    L --> M[Content-addressed manifest\nreproducible release evidence]
